                                            @Html.DropDownListFor(m => m.Currency, new SelectList(ViewBag.Currency, "Value", "Text", Model.Currency), "Select Currency", new { @class = "form-control form-select", @id = "ddlCurrency" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.Currency, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-1 pl-0">
                                            <div class="input-group">
                                                <a class=" btn  btn-sm" href="javascript:void(0);" title="Add Contact Person" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#mediumModal"><i class="fa fa-plus-square"></i></a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Telephone 1</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Telephone1, new { @class = "form-control", @rows = "3", @placeholder = "Telephone 1", @maxlength = "10" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Telephone1, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Telephone 2</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Telephone2, new { @class = "form-control", @rows = "3", @placeholder = "Telephone 2", @maxlength = "10" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Telephone2, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="section-right">
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Mobile<span class="text-danger p-1">(*)</span></label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Mobile, new { @class = "form-control", @rows = "3", @placeholder = "Mobile", @required = "required", @maxlength = "10" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Mobile, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Email<span class="text-danger p-1">(*)</span></label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            <div class="input-group">
                                                @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Email, new { @placeholder = "Email", @class = "form-control", @required = "required", @maxlength = "50" })
                                                <div class="input-group-addon"><i class="fa fa-envelope-o"></i></div>
                                            </div>
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Email, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Web Site</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.WebSite, new { @placeholder = "Web Site", @class = "form-control", @maxlength = "50" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.WebSite, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Fax</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.Fax, new { @placeholder = "Fax", @class = "form-control", @maxlength = "10" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Fax, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Contact Person</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextBoxFor(m => m.ContactPerson, new { @placeholder = "Contact Person", @class = "form-control" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.ContactPerson, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })

                                        </div>

                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3"><label class=" form-control-label">Industry</label></div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                                            @Html.DropDownListFor(m => m.Industry, new SelectList(ViewBag.Industry, "Value", "Text", Model.Industry), "Select Industry", new { @class = "form-control form-select", @id = "ddlIndustry" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.Industry, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-1 pl-0">
                                            <div class="input-group">
                                                <a class=" btn  btn-sm" href="javascript:void(0);" title="Add Contact Person" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#mediumModal"><i class="fa fa-plus-square"></i></a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3"><label class=" form-control-label">Sales Person</label></div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                                            @Html.DropDownListFor(m => m.SalesPerson, new SelectList(ViewBag.SalesPerson, "Value", "Text", Model.SalesPerson), "Select Sales Person", new { @class = "form-control form-select", @id = "ddlSalesPerson" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.SalesPerson, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-1 pl-0">
                                            <div class="input-group">
                                                <a class=" btn  btn-sm" href="javascript:void(0);" title="Add Contact Person" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#mediumModal"><i class="fa fa-plus-square"></i></a>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="row form-group">
                                        <div class="col col-md-3">
                                            <label for="text-input" class=" form-control-label">Remarks</label>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
                                            @Html.TextAreaFor(m => m.Remarks, new { @class = "form-control", @rows = "3", @placeholder = "Remarks", @maxlength = "100" })
                                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(m => m.Remarks, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="detail">
                            <div class="page-breaker"></div>
                            <ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="myTab" role="tablist">
                                @*<li class="nav-item">
                                        <a class="nav-link active" id="home-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#general" role="tab" aria-controls="general" aria-selected="true">General</a>
                                    </li>*@
                                <li class="nav-item">
                                    <a class="nav-link active" id="profile-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#address" role="tab" aria-controls="address" aria-selected="true">Addresses</a>
                                </li>
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.PartyName))
                                {
                                    <li class="nav-item">
                                        <a class="nav-link" id="contact-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#otherdetail" role="tab" aria-controls="otherdetail" aria-selected="false">Other Details</a>
                                    </li>

                                    <li class="nav-item">
                                        <a class="nav-link" id="contact-tab" data-toggle="tab" href="#attachment" role="tab" aria-controls="attachment" aria-selected="false">Attachment</a>
                                    </li>
                                }
                            </ul>
                            <div class="tab-content pl-3 p-1" id="myTabContent">
                                <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="address" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="profile-tab">
